  "description": "In his hurried transfer to a rural school, Hyoun meets Seonhong, a bright and cheerful classmate who is everything he is not. As often happens with first love, the two quickly become each other’s whole world. But one day, Seonhong vanishes like smoke, leaving behind nothing but memories of a brilliant love at eighteen. Ten years later, they cross paths again by chance at a blind date arranged for Seonhong. Overwhelmed by the pain of being abandoned, Hyoun greets her not with joy, but with betrayal and vengeance.\n\n*\"Have you thought about it? Ten million won for one night.\"*\n\nTheir love is now tangled with resentment and regret. Can something so broken ever be mended into love again?\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
